{"aliases":[],"ancestry":{"derived_from":[],"mutation_dimensions":["companion_count","companion_loyalty","companion_growth","companion_control_level"],"observed_in":["cross-game design analysis"],"source_games":["broguece","cataclysm-bn","crawl","nethack"]},"concept_type":"design_primitive","concrete_examples":[{"description":"In NetHack, players can tame and recruit pets, primarily dogs and cats, which assist in combat by distracting enemies and can also fetch items. Players develop an emotional connection with their pets, as losing one can significantly impact gameplay and strategy.","game":"nethack","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-105c-7471-9097-eba20ef063d0","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-0ff2-7c4a-8dca-3ad51254fb2d","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-105c-7e49-8096-99bd4133a95c","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-101f-71d2-b61d-ebe6ab4407df","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1015-78ea-b965-bce1d637628b","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1016-7d3b-a510-5f755a1a5da5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1035-7587-8212-b8fff6e89b38","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-105e-7674-8c9f-7e96c2c524fc","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1028-71a6-a934-2684be94ff9a","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1054-74d3-8b0f-bbf4c43c068d"],"source_file":"src/pet.c"},{"description":"In Broguece, players can encounter and recruit various creatures that assist in combat and exploration, each with unique abilities and attributes that enhance gameplay strategies. Managing these companions adds depth to decision-making and fosters emotional connections as players invest in their development and survival.","game":"broguece","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-ee8b-73e2-80d7-1e50b5c7138f","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-efc6-78e0-bf3a-6397976bddba","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-ee78-7bb7-91c7-6648f4ceaada","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-f146-7325-b836-ab5ecff5f050","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-edd5-75c6-8644-0afac44b93c3","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-eec0-7965-a19a-73a534a7b457","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-efd5-796f-85c8-11373d8e2bdc","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-ee9a-7c49-b34a-05a2958cf382","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-efb2-716d-baaf-f830cf57493b","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-ef90-74a4-864e-7eb602416c22"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In 'Crawl', players can recruit various pets, such as dogs and cats, which follow them into dungeons and assist in combat by attacking enemies or distracting them. The management of these companions adds strategic layers to gameplay, as players must consider their pets' health and behavior while navigating dangerous environments.","game":"crawl","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3522-7a76-8143-b51f0f4a61a9","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3523-7de7-82e0-2166fde82cc9","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3523-7923-9d7c-1ba3c5ce5b57","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3523-70cc-92b3-c6fef0067cb0","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3523-7221-9cdb-baa12964b689","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3523-7cb5-a923-a189d3c7d2e7","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3523-7005-ac5c-68409a5737fa","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3523-761b-8a6e-a5113d8705f5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3524-7ea8-8299-3e6e55a44f8a","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f8f-3524-7631-8a1f-1ac002a17a6a"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In cataclysm-bn, players can encounter and tame various animal companions that assist in combat, provide utility, and can even carry items. The management of these companions adds strategic depth, as players must care for their pets, considering their health, morale, and capabilities during exploration and combat.","game":"cataclysm-bn","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-931d-76d0-a235-1ba9091de2c1","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-934b-7d59-8af3-dfc7e65e1958","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9323-79ec-96f2-392904977df1","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-934b-77e9-a417-6a095096a9cc","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-934f-70d5-af0b-34a50454509d","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-934f-7b46-b612-6eb1c2da3739","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9331-76c1-928d-db70f5537f8b","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9331-7ac3-b850-05dcbd52908e","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9331-781b-8fb7-b467d00b85ce","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02a6b-9331-7438-b542-db23f2ccfd2c"],"source_file":""}],"decision_refs":[],"definition":"A game mechanic where players can tame, recruit, or start with companion creatures that assist in combat, exploration, or utility. Companions add strategic depth through management of another entity but also create emotional attachment and risk.","epistemic":{"confidence":"inferred","status":"observed"},"evidence_refs":[],"exclusion_criteria":["Summoned creatures that exist for a single turn only","NPCs that fight alongside player as scripted events","Mounts that are purely cosmetic"],"id":"urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a03267-890e-7b79-873b-b5d41b8133b1","implementation_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-105c-7471-9097-eba20ef063d0","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-0ff2-7c4a-8dca-3ad51254fb2d","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-105c-7e49-8096-99bd4133a95c","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-101f-71d2-b61d-ebe6ab4407df","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1015-78ea-b965-bce1d637628b","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1016-7d3b-a510-5f755a1a5da5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1035-7587-8212-b8fff6e89b38","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-105e-7674-8c9f-7e96c2c524fc","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1028-71a6-a934-2684be94ff9a","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1054-74d3-8b0f-bbf4c43c068d","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9c-ee8b-73e2-80d7-1e50b5c7138f","urn:roguelike-games-ib:reco